1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,106
Is it possible?

2
00:00:01,106 --> 00:00:13,971
We will soon prove that the best any engine can do between these temperatures is the Carnot efficiency, one minus T two over T one: one minus three hundred over five hundred, forty percent.

3
00:00:13,971 --> 00:00:18,411
Thirty is below forty, so this engine breaks no law.

4
00:00:18,411 --> 00:00:21,184
It is possible, though not reversible.

